  45:../src/hal/hal_pwm.c ****  * @brief Sets the PWM duty cycle
  46:../src/hal/hal_pwm.c ****  * The PWM signal is lowpass filtered to produce a voltage which is input to the stepper controller
  47:../src/hal/hal_pwm.c ****  * The output voltage is given by: v_out = V_ref * u16_Duty_Cycle/(2^16-1)
  48:../src/hal/hal_pwm.c ****  * @param instance The actual instance of the PWM generator in case system has more than one.
